## Multi-root workspace layout (this milestone spans {{ workspace_repos | length }} repos)

This milestone is built from a **workspace** of independent git repositories, not a single repo. The instructions above that say `/testbed` apply **per repo** with these substitutions:

| Single-repo wording | Workspace equivalent |
|---|---|
| Repository at `/testbed` | Repo `<repo>` at `/workspace/<repo>/` (one git repo each) |
| `RUN rm -rf /testbed` + `COPY . /testbed/` | `RUN rm -rf /workspace` + `COPY . /workspace/` (the host build context `{{ repo_path }}` holds one directory per repo plus `manifest.json`) |
| `RUN cd /testbed && git reset --hard HEAD` | `RUN for d in /workspace/*/; do git -C "$d" reset --hard HEAD; done` |
| `git checkout {{ base_state }}` / `{{ end_state }}` | the same tag names exist in **every** repo; switch all repos together: `for d in /workspace/*/; do git -C "$d" checkout -f <TAG>; done` |
| `git -C {{ repo_path }} rev-parse <tag>` | `git -C {{ repo_path }}/<repo> rev-parse <tag>` (a repo untouched by this milestone has identical start and end trees) |

